{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.92, "text": "And she had had a double lung transplant."}, {"start": 3.02, "end": 5.64, "text": "And she had successfully had the transplant,"}, {"start": 5.78, "end": 6.7, "text": "and she was alive."}, {"start": 7.76, "end": 11.62, "text": "She was healthy, but she knew that she"}, {"start": 11.62, "end": 13.92, "text": "would live five or 10 more years."}, {"start": 14.76, "end": 16.34, "text": "That's what the doctors told her."}, {"start": 16.88, "end": 19.72, "text": "And she said, I want to share this time with my daughters."}, {"start": 20.02, "end": 22.96, "text": "They were around 11 and 12, her husband."}, {"start": 24.86, "end": 26.3, "text": "And I want to do that."}, {"start": 26.78, "end": 28.56, "text": "I said, OK, what's stopping you?"}, {"start": 29.07, "end": 31.38, "text": "And she said, well, I still have a job."}, {"start": 32.06, "end": 33.3, "text": "And I looked at her financials."}, {"start": 33.34, "end": 34.36, "text": "They were multimillionaires."}, {"start": 34.86, "end": 38.46, "text": "They had saved consistently, doing index funds over time,"}, {"start": 38.58, "end": 40.72, "text": "nothing fancy, just consistent investing."}, {"start": 41.88, "end": 44.1, "text": "She could stop working tomorrow, and they"}, {"start": 44.1, "end": 47.06, "text": "would have enough money forever."}, {"start": 48.48, "end": 49.12, "text": "She couldn't stop."}, {"start": 49.6, "end": 51.02, "text": "She said, I like to work."}, {"start": 51.18, "end": 52.66, "text": "I like knowing that I have a job."}, {"start": 52.94, "end": 54.96, "text": "I like the consistent income."}, {"start": 55.9, "end": 59.86, "text": "So most people are used to getting an income."}, {"start": 60.46, "end": 62.5, "text": "And that's why they find it so difficult to retire,"}, {"start": 62.52, "end": 65.06, "text": "among other reasons, because the income will stop."}, {"start": 65.38, "end": 66.96, "text": "Even though I can point out to them,"}, {"start": 67.22, "end": 69.78, "text": "the investment portfolio you've built and social security"}, {"start": 69.78, "end": 71.24, "text": "and all these things will actually pay you,"}, {"start": 71.9, "end": 74.68, "text": "people are terrified of not seeing that money come"}, {"start": 74.68, "end": 75.72, "text": "into their checking account."}, {"start": 76.24, "end": 78.86, "text": "In this case, she had a ticking clock."}, {"start": 79.54, "end": 82.18, "text": "We all have a clock, but she knew how long hers would go"}, {"start": 82.18, "end": 82.36, "text": "for."}, {"start": 83.08, "end": 86.48, "text": "She found it incredibly difficult to quit her job"}, {"start": 86.48, "end": 87.4, "text": "and spend time with her."}], "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.08}, {"w": "she", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.28}, {"w": "had", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.46}, {"w": "had", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.68}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.86}, {"w": "double", "start": 0.86, "end": 1.12}, {"w": "lung", "start": 1.12, "end": 1.38}, {"w": "transplant.", "start": 1.38, "end": 1.92}, {"w": "And", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.5}, {"w": "she", "start": 3.5, "end": 3.98}, {"w": "had", "start": 3.98, "end": 4.12}, {"w": "successfully", "start": 4.12, "end": 4.64}, {"w": "had", "start": 4.64, "end": 5.0}, {"w": "the", "start": 5.0, "end": 5.2}, {"w": "transplant,", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.64}, {"w": "and", "start": 5.78, "end": 5.82}, {"w": "she", "start": 5.82, "end": 6.22}, {"w": "was", "start": 6.22, "end": 6.34}, {"w": "alive.", "start": 6.34, "end": 6.7}, {"w": "She", "start": 7.76, "end": 7.98}, {"w": "was", "start": 7.98, "end": 8.08}, {"w": "healthy,", "start": 8.08, "end": 8.42}, {"w": "but", "start": 8.92, "end": 9.28}, {"w": "she", "start": 9.28, "end": 10.4}, {"w": "knew", "start": 10.4, "end": 10.62}, {"w": "that", "start": 10.62, "end": 10.98}, {"w": "she", "start": 10.98, "end": 11.62}, {"w": "would", "start": 11.62, "end": 11.76}, {"w": "live", "star